  "body": "Imagine opening the doors from your living room and stepping onto a large outdoor balcony, with an unobstructed sea view in front of you. At 110B Stredwick Drive, this could be your everyday place to pause, relax and enjoy the coast.\r\n\r\nThe light-filled living and dining area connects directly to the approximately 20m² balcony. Host a weekend BBQ, share a meal with family and friends, or settle in with a drink and take in the view. The easy flow between indoors and outdoors gives everyone more room to enjoy time together.\r\n\r\nThis brand-new freehold home offers approximately 158m² of interior space, with three generously sized bedrooms and two well-proportioned bathrooms. Every bedroom enjoys excellent natural light. The spacious master bedroom has its own ensuite and a beautiful sea view to wake up to.\r\n\r\nEveryday practicality has been considered as well. The internal-access garage includes a storage room, with outdoor space for one or two additional vehicles, depending on their size. The easy-care section leaves you more time to enjoy the home and the neighborhood, and the CCC and Title have been issued.\r\n\r\nSet in a quiet, private Torbay location, the home is conveniently placed for Torbay Village, Long Bay and Waiake Beach. It is zoned for Glamorgan School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nStep from the living room onto the balcony and see the view for yourself. Contact us today to arrange a private viewing and take the next step towards making this your home or your next investment.\r\n\r\nAll conjunctional agents welcome.\r\n\r\nOpen Home:\r\nSaturdays and Sundays, 11:15 AM – 12:00 PM\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
